nix-prefetch-url --unpack https://github.com/NixOS/nix/archive/2.35.2.tar.gz
fetchFromGitHub unpacks; the hash is over the unpacked tree (hash / outputHashMode = "recursive"), not the .tar.gz bytes. That is why a fetchurl hash and a fetchFromGitHub hash for “the same release” differ.


